<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Knightsbridge Tankers.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Knightsbridge Tankers.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Knightsbridge Tankers Ltd as a market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Analyst declined to comment on the move.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/8 to 22-1/8 in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
